    "nombre": "Ronald Wong",
    "foto": null,
    "biografia_limpia": "Ronald Wong is a Hong Kong Hot Wheels designer who has worked with Mattel since 2014, initially as an intern before joining Mattel full-time as a Product Designer; he currently manages the Hot Wheels Premium line. He is noted to prioritize track performance for his designs; many of his designs are noted to be of high-end exotic cars. In addition to cars, he has designed a number of larger-scale vehicles and track sets. In addition to his design work at Mattel, Wong is also a photographer, photographing Hong Kong's car culture; he is also a collector of Hot Wheels and other larger scale diecast models, having maintained a collection since his childhood. He can be found under the internet handle ronalderw.",
    "bio_es": null,
    "bio_en": "Ronald Wong is a Hong Kong Hot Wheels designer who has worked with Mattel since 2014, initially as an intern before joining Mattel full-time as a Product Designer; he currently manages the Hot Wheels Premium line. He is noted to prioritize track performance for his designs; many of his designs are noted to be of high-end exotic cars. In addition to cars, he has designed a number of larger-scale vehicles and track sets. In addition to his design work at Mattel, Wong is also a photographer, photographing Hong Kong's car culture; he is also a collector of Hot Wheels and other larger scale diecast models, having maintained a collection since his childhood. He can be found under the internet handle ronalderw.",
    "bio_pt": null,
