    "nombre": "Ted Wu",
    "foto": null,
    "biografia_limpia": "Theodore Wu III is a Chinese-American Mattel employee who has been working at Mattel since 2003. Initially employed as an associate producer, he quickly worked up the ranks to eventually become a senior marketing manager; he eventually became the vice-president of design for Hot Wheels in 2015, taking over from Felix Holst. He is currently the senior vice-president and global head of design, vehicles and building sets, a position he has held since 2024.",
